MODULE: RepairWrongPhysicalTarget
TARGET: EffectExact
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the repair writes the other physical generation instead of its captured target
PERTURBS: PublishRepair

--- FIND
    /\ rows' = [v \in Views |-> [rows[v] EXCEPT ![target[v]] = captured[v]]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ rows' = [v \in Views |-> [rows[v] EXCEPT ![1-target[v]] = captured[v]]]
--- END
